  "prefLabel": "Pas 301.13 Qualified personnel",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Pas 301.13 “Qualified personnel” means individuals, who, as a result of training and experience, understand and demonstrate competence with design, construction, operation, or maintenance of passenger tramways and associated hazards.\n\nSource. ##13429-B, eff 8-6-22 (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Pas 300)",
